# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deny by default.
#
# This repository is a public write-up only. No source code, no flight logs,
# no vehicle parameters, no calibration data. Everything is ignored unless it
# is explicitly re-allowed below, so a stray file copied into this folder is
# invisible to git until someone deliberately allows it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*

# --- allowed: the write-up itself ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# --- allowed: images used by the README (directory first, then contents) ---
!assets/
!assets/*.png
!assets/*.jpg
!assets/*.jpeg
!assets/*.gif
!assets/*.svg
!assets/*.webp

!docs/
!docs/**/
!docs/**/*.md
!docs/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.jpg
!docs/**/*.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Second layer. Even inside an allowed folder, these never go up -- protects
# against a source file or a log dropped into assets/ or docs/ by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.py
*.pyc
*.ipynb
*.sh
*.bat
*.ps1
*.c
*.cpp
*.h
*.hpp

*.csv
*.tsv
*.log
*.bin
*.tlog
*.BIN
*.ulg
*.db
*.sqlite3

*.param
*.parm
*.waypoints
*.mission
*.npz
*.npy
*.yaml
*.yml
*.json
*.xml
*.sdf
*.urdf

*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.h264
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.env
.env*
*credentials*
*secret*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
